{"id":"ba6dceed64879da7","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-cor-black-scholes.md","title":"Black–Scholes Formula","display":"cor-black-scholes — Black–Scholes Formula","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-black-scholes","aliases":["58-cor-black-scholes"],"display":"cor-black-scholes — Black–Scholes Formula","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-black-scholes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-black-scholes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-black-scholes — Black–Scholes Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85e7af0f6e9d7688\" href=\"?note=85e7af0f6e9d7688\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md\">../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,W,S,H,Y_t,C_t,G_t,d_1,d_2\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,W,S,H,Y_t,C_t,G_t,d_1,d_2\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (probability-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md\">../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (Brownian-motion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"948f8f3178040b74\" href=\"?note=948f8f3178040b74\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md\">../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (geometric-Brownian-motion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"85e7af0f6e9d7688\" href=\"?note=85e7af0f6e9d7688\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md\">../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (fully parameterized conditional-expectation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e4ee9615831113b\" href=\"?note=2e4ee9615831113b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md\">../batch16/58-df-expectation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,T\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land t\\in[0,T)\">\\(K,T\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land t\\in[0,T)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:\\mathbb{R}\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\Phi:\\mathbb{R}\\to[0,1]\\)</span> (standard normal distribution function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,Y_t,C_t,G_t,d_1,d_2\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\">\\(H,Y_t,C_t,G_t,d_1,d_2\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\)</span> (payoff, conditional-expectation version, price, explicit value, and pointwise parameters)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}black\\text{-}scholes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S(S,W,r,\\sigma,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q)\n\\land K&gt;0\n\\land 0\\leq t&lt;T\n\\land \\sigma&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(H(\\omega)=(S(T)(\\omega)-K)^+\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y_t,H,\\mathcal F_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\left(\nd_1(\\omega)=\\frac{\\log(S(t)(\\omega)/K)+(r+\\sigma^2/2)(T-t)}\n{\\sigma\\sqrt{T-t}}\n\\land d_2(\\omega)=d_1(\\omega)-\\sigma\\sqrt{T-t}\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(\n\\Phi(z)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{z}e^{-u^2/2}\\,du\n\\right)\n\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\left(\nC_t(\\omega)=e^{-r(T-t)}Y_t(\\omega)\n\\land G_t(\\omega)=S(t)(\\omega)\\Phi(d_1(\\omega))-Ke^{-r(T-t)}\\Phi(d_2(\\omega))\n\\right)\n\\land\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(e^{r(T-t)}G_t,H,\\mathcal F_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:C_t(\\omega)\\neq G_t(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathbb Q\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:C_t(\\omega)\\neq G_t(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}black\\text{-}scholes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S(S,W,r,\\sigma,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q)\n\\land K&gt;0\n\\land 0\\leq t&lt;T\n\\land \\sigma&gt;0\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(H(\\omega)=(S(T)(\\omega)-K)^+\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y_t,H,\\mathcal F_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\left(\nd_1(\\omega)=\\frac{\\log(S(t)(\\omega)/K)+(r+\\sigma^2/2)(T-t)}\n{\\sigma\\sqrt{T-t}}\n\\land d_2(\\omega)=d_1(\\omega)-\\sigma\\sqrt{T-t}\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(\n\\Phi(z)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{z}e^{-u^2/2}\\,du\n\\right)\n\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\left(\nC_t(\\omega)=e^{-r(T-t)}Y_t(\\omega)\n\\land G_t(\\omega)=S(t)(\\omega)\\Phi(d_1(\\omega))-Ke^{-r(T-t)}\\Phi(d_2(\\omega))\n\\right)\n\\land\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(e^{r(T-t)}G_t,H,\\mathcal F_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:C_t(\\omega)\\neq G_t(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathbb Q\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:C_t(\\omega)\\neq G_t(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Brownian-motion and geometric-Brownian predicates use their exact upstream argument order and include the probability space and filtration.</li>\n<li>The available Brownian-motion atom does not by itself state independence of future increments from the supplied filtration.  The second conditional-expectation premise therefore records the missing verification that the explicit Black–Scholes candidate is a version of the payoff conditional expectation.</li>\n<li>Conditional expectation is defined only up to almost-sure equality, so the conclusion is stated outside a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>-null event.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md","status":"resolved","id":"85e7af0f6e9d7688","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3$ (probability-space predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-probability-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md","status":"resolved","id":"948f8f3178040b74","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (Brownian-motion predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-brownian-motion.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md","status":"resolved","id":"85e7af0f6e9d7688","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8$ (geometric-Brownian-motion predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-geometric-brownian.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-expectation.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e4ee9615831113b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6$ (fully parameterized conditional-expectation predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-expectation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,W,S,H,Y_t,C_t,G_t,d_1,d_2\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CondExp}_S\\subseteq V^6","display":false},{"tex":"K,T\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land t\\in[0,T)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\sigma\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi:\\mathbb{R}\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"H,Y_t,C_t,G_t,d_1,d_2\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}black\\text{-}scholes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{BrownianMotion}_S(W,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\mathrm{GeometricBrownianMotion}_S(S,W,r,\\sigma,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F_\\bullet,\\mathbb Q)\n\\land K>0\n\\land 0\\leq t<T\n\\land \\sigma>0\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\bigl(H(\\omega)=(S(T)(\\omega)-K)^+\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(Y_t,H,\\mathcal F_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\left(\nd_1(\\omega)=\\frac{\\log(S(t)(\\omega)/K)+(r+\\sigma^2/2)(T-t)}\n{\\sigma\\sqrt{T-t}}\n\\land d_2(\\omega)=d_1(\\omega)-\\sigma\\sqrt{T-t}\n\\right)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\forall z\\in\\mathbb R\\;\n\\left(\n\\Phi(z)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}\n\\int_{-\\infty}^{z}e^{-u^2/2}\\,du\n\\right)\n\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega\\;\\left(\nC_t(\\omega)=e^{-r(T-t)}Y_t(\\omega)\n\\land G_t(\\omega)=S(t)(\\omega)\\Phi(d_1(\\omega))-Ke^{-r(T-t)}\\Phi(d_2(\\omega))\n\\right)\n\\land\\operatorname{CondExp}_S(e^{r(T-t)}G_t,H,\\mathcal F_t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb Q)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\n\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:C_t(\\omega)\\neq G_t(\\omega)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mathbb Q\\bigl(\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega:C_t(\\omega)\\neq G_t(\\omega)\\}\\bigr)=0.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false}],"bytes":3195,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-cor-black-scholes.md|58-cor-black-scholes]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["85e7af0f6e9d7688","0578a357a86e9d8f","948f8f3178040b74","2e4ee9615831113b"]}